      "node_id": "kg_doc_10",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Edith Mary Oldham Ellis (née Lees; 1861, Manchester – 1916, Paddington, London) was an English writer and women's rights activist. She was married to the early sexologist Havelock Ellis.",
